<Base title="About" description="About AI Tools Weekly — a free weekly newsletter and directory of AI tools for small business owners.">
  <h1>About AI Tools Weekly</h1>

  <p>
    AI Tools Weekly is a free newsletter and directory for small business owners who want to use AI to save time and grow faster — without having to spend hours researching every new tool that launches.
  </p>

  <p>
    Every Monday morning, we scan the latest AI tool launches, ask our AI assistant to summarise the best ones, and send you a tight, no-fluff digest with exactly what you need to know: what the tool does, who it's for, and what it costs.
  </p>

  <h2>The directory</h2>
  <p>
    Our <a href="/tools">tool directory</a> lists every AI tool we've reviewed, organised by category — Productivity, Content, Customer Support, Finance, HR, Sales, and Design. Each listing links directly to the tool so you can try it.
  </p>

  <h2>How we pick tools</h2>
  <p>
    We focus on tools that are genuinely useful for small business owners: practical, affordable, and with a clear ROI. We don't cover enterprise-only software or tools with no free trial.
  </p>

  <h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
  <p>
    Some links on this site and in the newsletter are affiliate links. If you click a link and sign up for a paid plan, we may earn a commission — at no extra cost to you. This is how we keep the newsletter free. We only recommend tools we'd actually use.
  </p>

  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>
    Questions, tool suggestions, or sponsorship enquiries: <a href="mailto:hello@aitoolsweekly.com">hello@aitoolsweekly.com</a>
  </p>

  <div style="margin-top:3rem">
    <a href="/#subscribe" class="btn btn-primary">Subscribe — it's free →</a>
  </div>
</Base>
